Package: dsc-bridge
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libnss3-tools, zenity, libsecret-1-0, opensc
Maintainer: e-Sign <support@e-sign.local>
Description: DSC Bridge - digital signature signing agent
 A small local tray agent that lets the browser sign documents with a
 hardware DSC (Digital Signature Certificate) USB token via PKCS#11.
 The browser talks to it over https://127.0.0.1:4645. After install it
 starts automatically on login and trusts its own certificate in the
 user's browsers, so signing needs no manual setup.
